He asked when the vehicle came. Answer with the time it arrived from the evidence (the house recorder's recording), in one short line, and say the video just sent (if one was) is from the recording at that moment. If he asked when someone got out of it, say the video shows the arrival and that you did not see in the recording exactly when someone got out; never invent that time. No watch, no "I will tell you when", no apology, no question.
